"MIBLReverseClaimTransformer.java file mein, line 97 pe ek code hai jo AccidentTime field ke pehle 5 characters nikalta hai (substring(0,5)). Problem ye hai — agar MIBL se aaye data mein AccidentTime field khali ya missing hota hai, to code crash ho jata hai, kyunki khali string mein 5 characters hote hi nahi hain. Ye error maine CloudWatch logs mein ek specific claim ke liye dekha — StringIndexOutOfBoundsException naam ka Java error. Isse us claim ka reverse-sync (settlement data MIBL ko wapas bhejna) fail ho jata hai."

