"Code mein pehle check lagana hoga ki field ka length kam se kam 5 hai ya nahi, tabhi substring lena hai — warna poori string ya default value use karni hai. Abhi maine ye apne lead ko discuss karne ke liye flag kiya hai, khud fix nahi kiya."
